  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a small skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until caramelized, about 15 minutes.",
    "Mince the garlic and add it to the skillet, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the cumin, coriander, and cayenne pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fromage frais to the skillet, stirring until heated through.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro.",
    "Spoon the mixture into 4 individual mini cocottes or ramekins.",
    "Bake in a preheated oven at 375°F for 10-12 minutes, or until set and lightly browned on top.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving."
